-4"><summary class="cursor-pointer text-sm font-extrabold text-indigo-900">Ver borrador de mensaje (no enviado)</summary><p class="mt-3 text-sm leading-6 text-neutral-700"><?=$escape($item['suggested_message'])?></p></details><?php endif;?>
